{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"dfb8e699c79658947298c214b8b7fd94b6c277f4cc59b921b5803366a5f25254","ja":"愛をもって真実を","zh":"用爱探寻真相","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0878c8a88efe89ec5f13d32582730da15888149b3da1230737cfe105c0885eff","ja":"後日、様々な証言を得た亜利沙と恵美は、\nお互いの取材内容を確認して……","zh":"日后，获得了各种证言的亚利沙和惠美，\n确认彼此的采访内容后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d8110e86dcc24fd7b459f8557221f5f34f706e02bfb574b125dbe9c30b7f6771","ja":"一通り取材できたけど、これって……。","zh":"采访也算告一段落了，可这……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b4a775a4adac5246470337b04b25f7473791da7ff12351a05b23ccaf797425a3","ja":"まず、『あのアイドルたちが不仲』って記事、\nライブの演出でアイデアを出し合ってただけなんだね！","zh":"首先，所谓“那些偶像关系不和”的报道，\n原来只是她们在为演唱会演出互相出主意啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f38263e14590992d862919749f231f94d0629a10830c27af70ffb4e334063524","ja":"話が盛り上がって、つい声が大きくなっただけ、\nだったそうです。共演者の方の証言もバッチリですよ！","zh":"听说只是聊得兴起，不知不觉声音大了些，\n仅此而已。共演者的证言也完全吻合哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b6948f76147dcf56c7dfc554ffaa9a42d8d24f496ba5b53c3994d8e1369cc658","ja":"それをケンカだ険悪だなんて！　アイドルちゃんの\n真剣さをなんだと思っているんでしょう！","zh":"把那说成是在吵架、关系恶劣什么的！\n你们把偶像们的认真当成什么了啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d6268328beaad087a569242e2b93db9365187bb1a72748eb929065ff239cd42d","ja":"いいライブにしようとしてただけなのに、\n悪く言われるなんて、悲しいよね……。","zh":"明明只是想把演唱会办好，\n却被人说得那么难听，真让人难过呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"156f446a65d61a08f8a57fe9f7c51b39e64a2ad36a47ebc3ce2dbef879cf4d36","ja":"それに、『熱愛発覚』も\n確認をとればすぐわかるものでしたね。","zh":"而且，“热恋曝光”也是\n只要确认一下就能立刻知道呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ec3d5418ed3f2e81d15757836a39c307500ee6f150739e69058e7c00a636576e","ja":"「一緒にいるの、お父さんだよ」って言われて、\nあっという間に真相がわかっちゃったよ！","zh":"「你和在一起的是你爸爸吧」被这么说之后，\n真相瞬间就明白了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"20f6c087b2772a3854a00dcd15b7d2d30757cb248ef1c5b33b4891c15acebad9","ja":"家族と仲良く過ごしてただけなのに、\nヒミツの恋人だとか、失礼しちゃうよ！","zh":"只是和家人和睦相处而已，\n说什么“秘密恋人”，太失礼了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ad0755086d746c0e87be699bdab387f87073bd71db987fb4b157d77b8096911a","ja":"『実力を偽るアイドル』も、練習で難易度の高い\nパフォーマンスに挑んで、ミスしただけでしたね。","zh":"“伪装实力的偶像”那件事，也只是她在练习中\n挑战高难度表演时失误了而已。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"653889280d9ebf4f04fd9cf368ece008f21895c5dd55119d5ced4b42a8893a5d","ja":"も～！　写真以外、全部デタラメじゃん！","zh":"真是的！除了照片之外，全都是瞎编的嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"356f7dc2d91f18c2cef5239502d8f8ad0e13cc194d88d5446d58e4983d43e5c3","ja":"まったくです！　わかってしまえば、アイドルちゃんの\nすばらしさを伝えるエピソードばかりです！","zh":"就是说嘛！一旦弄清楚，偶像小姐的\n全是能传达其魅力的精彩趣事呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2d0d5dfa533354e6f18d2a99fad85696f85f5b4c78e8e24c0374d70ca28a2d4a","ja":"このことを、早くファンのみんなにも\n教えてあげなきゃだね！","zh":"这件事也得赶紧\n告诉粉丝们呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5acff7f35cc3fe08954c7b3ac05ae81187dcd0705c5edc8882ba66dcf5160bfd","ja":"はい！　アイドルちゃんはみんな素敵なんだと、\n世界中へしっかりバッチリ発信しちゃいましょう！","zh":"好的！偶像们全都很了不起，\n让我们向全世界彻彻底底地传播出去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1821.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"738fbe8e8e09f6f7842a9ac39a2ae0dbe7684e47bf03bcff8ec4929da8d7edbf","ja":"アイドルちゃんの真実は、ありさたちが守るのです！\nふぉー！　燃えてきましたよ～！","zh":"偶像们的真相，就由亚利沙我们来守护！\n呼哦！我燃起来了哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
